@startuml
title Mediator / Controller

skinparam legendBackgroundColor #f9f9f9
skinparam legendBorderColor #999999

legend right

**Intent**:
Encapsulate interactions among objects; promote loose coupling.

**Motivation**:
Forms/UI controls interacting via central mediator (dialog coordination).

**Applicability**:
Complex interaction networks; reduce direct dependencies.

**Participants**:
Mediator centralizes interactions; Colleagues communicate via mediator.

**Consequences**:
Pros: Reduced coupling; focused interaction logic.
Cons: Mediator can become complex; potential god-object.

**Implementation Notes**:
Use event buses; message passing; keep mediator cohesive.

**Known Uses**:
UI frameworks; message brokers; chat rooms.

**Related Patterns**:
Observer (pub/sub), Facade (simplify), Command (actions).

endlegend

interface Mediator {
  +notify(sender: Colleague, event:String)
}

class ConcreteMediator

abstract class Colleague {
  -mediator : Mediator
  +send(event:String)
  +receive(event:String)
}

class ColleagueA
class ColleagueB

Mediator <|.. ConcreteMediator
Colleague <|-- ColleagueA
Colleague <|-- ColleagueB
Colleague o-- Mediator
ConcreteMediator ..> ColleagueA
ConcreteMediator ..> ColleagueB
@enduml